      "content": "My investigation into urban ecology moves beyond siloed ecological metrics to examine how the complex, interwoven fabric of city infrastructure dictates avian biodiversity across temporal scales. Recognizing that isolated environmental factors obscure deeper truths, this project adopts a **systemic** approach, analyzing the interplay between concrete networks and natural habitats. By employing a **longitudinal** study across decades, my research seeks to understand the **transformative** effects of urbanization, suggesting a necessary **interdisciplinary** lens to re-evaluate established ecological **paradigm**.",
      "source": "target",
